{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed","id":251515,"title":"Random Silly Demon Things To Do-Quick, Fun Ways to Get Yourself Completely Killed.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-07T09:35:30-07:00","id":251515,"title":"Random Silly Demon Things To Do-Quick, Fun Ways to Get Yourself Completely Killed.","content":"Have a sense of humor and the God-machine'll find you. One can assume it doesn't have a funny bone in it's body, which is appropriate since it doesn't have a body, technically speaking.<br /> <br /> Still, players do, so while you might not do some things that occur to you while reading Demon because your character likes breathing(unless everything's FUBAR anyways), you definitely have things you wanna do. So, share them.<br /> <br /> I'll start with a question. Let's say things have gone to shit. You and your entire ring got found and are now being chased along the free way. Each of you are in different cars, and each of you knows Demon Car.You're screwed, so you figure &quot;Why not?&quot; and jam all your forms into your vehicles. You go at it for a while, and then one of your ringmates calls. He has merge. He explains just how screwed you are,and then proposes that you can use Merge and fuse all the cars together. And then he asks &quot;Why not?&quot;<br /> <br /> So the question is: is the following result the Frankestein monster of monster trucks, or did you just form Voltron?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-07-2014, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T09:45:42-07:00","id":251538,"title":"","content":"I would say Voltron <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T09:52:06-07:00","id":251542,"title":"","content":"No no... Its Menasaur. (( <a href=\"http://tfwiki.net/wiki/Menasor_%28G1%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://tfwiki.net/wiki/Menasor_%28G1%29</a> )) =D","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T13:58:22-07:00","id":251697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed?p=251538#post251538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say Voltron <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>But Vehicle Voltron is the Worst Voltron...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T14:41:54-07:00","id":251715,"title":"","content":"Step 1: Develop an Exploit similar to Demon Car, but derived from Quick Change, Clothes Make the Man, or other outfit-related Embeds.<br /> Step 2: Learn Context Matters.<br /> Step 3: Install these two Exploits into a lambda.<br /> Step 4: Become meguca.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T16:28:21-07:00","id":251758,"title":"","content":"Meduka is beauty.<br /> <br /> Actually, I've wanted to do a story about a demon who needs to really lay low and escape the city and can't turn to other demons, so he makes a series of gadgets and gets a human to play magical girl in order to distract demons and angels alike. from him.<br /> <br /> THe entire idea came from realizing I could do the magical girls thing with a Quick Change gadget and realizing demons make for a great subversion of the now popular Kyubey character idea-someone who looks like they act and move people coldly and rationally, but actually does care a lot about what happens to people who get caught up in their affair.(THere was a third factor that preceded either of those, but that's hard to explain without a lot of visual references) The Gadget rules were a godsend for this idea, because it set the stakes by showing how much one could use Gadgets before becoming stigmatic and therefore being permanently stuck in the game.<br /> <br /> I think it could be really cool, and could even make sense. Hell, I know we've all tossed the magical girl thing around on the forums, but I think Demon does it best, if I'm honest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-07-2014, 07:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T18:03:34-07:00","id":251797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed?p=251758#post251758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meduka is beauty.<br /> <br /> Actually, I've wanted to do a story about a demon who needs to really lay low and escape the city and can't turn to other demons, so he makes a series of gadgets and gets a human to play magical girl in order to distract demons and angels alike. from him.<br /> <br /> THe entire idea came from realizing I could do the magical girls thing with a Quick Change gadget and realizing demons make for a great subversion of the now popular Kyubey character idea-someone who looks like they act and move people coldly and rationally, but actually does care a lot about what happens to people who get caught up in their affair.(THere was a third factor that preceded either of those, but that's hard to explain without a lot of visual references) The Gadget rules were a godsend for this idea, because it set the stakes by showing how much one could use Gadgets before becoming stigmatic and therefore being permanently stuck in the game.<br /> <br /> I think it could be really cool, and could even make sense. Hell, I know we've all tossed the magical girl thing around on the forums, but I think Demon does it best, if I'm honest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, Demon and Changeling are the two primary bases I've used for Mahou Shoujo ideas so far, and for good reason.<br /> <br /> Admittedly part of that is down to the bulk of my meguca-watching experience so far being PreCure, where angelic motifs abound in the late-season upgrades and the metafranchise runneth over with an unending diversity of themes for misery-harvesting corrupting forces, but Princess Tutu's clockwork motif and concern with the significance of roles has resonance for both games, as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T18:47:35-07:00","id":251812,"title":"","content":"Is this the fabled Princess: The Hopeful xx Demon: The Descent cross over? I'm perversely curious as to how that would run... What kind of of plot would you use with that one?<br /> <br /> Back on topic, in another thread I think we discussed trying to extract aether from <i>non</i>- G-M essence as a YOLO way of making a large demon-sized splatter.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T19:34:52-07:00","id":251871,"title":"","content":"No, it wasn't a cross over. It was a mortals Demon: The Descent game(Story, actually, I think I wanted more control over this idea) that had played a lot with the magical girl genre and it's deconstructions/subversions.<br /> <br /> As for the Aether, it'd be a mess all over the place, that's for sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T19:37:32-07:00","id":251872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed?p=251715#post251715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Step 1: Develop an Exploit similar to Demon Car, but derived from Quick Change, Clothes Make the Man, or other outfit-related Embeds.<br /> Step 2: Learn Context Matters.<br /> Step 3: Install these two Exploits into a lambda.<br /> Step 4: Become meguca.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you misspelling Madoka?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T19:40:58-07:00","id":251873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed?p=251758#post251758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meduka is beauty.<br /> <br /> Actually, I've wanted to do a story about a demon who needs to really lay low and escape the city and can't turn to other demons, so he makes a series of gadgets and gets a human to play magical girl in order to distract demons and angels alike. from him.<br /> <br /> THe entire idea came from realizing I could do the magical girls thing with a Quick Change gadget and realizing demons make for a great subversion of the now popular Kyubey character idea-someone who looks like they act and move people coldly and rationally, but actually does care a lot about what happens to people who get caught up in their affair.(THere was a third factor that preceded either of those, but that's hard to explain without a lot of visual references) The Gadget rules were a godsend for this idea, because it set the stakes by showing how much one could use Gadgets before becoming stigmatic and therefore being permanently stuck in the game.<br /> <br /> I think it could be really cool, and could even make sense. Hell, I know we've all tossed the magical girl thing around on the forums, but I think Demon does it best, if I'm honest.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually use an Exile as a Kyubey Expy. This Exile has unexpectedly learned how to create pacts ( an indicator of how close he is to falling), and he acts as an &quot;frenemy&quot; to the ring and their human allies, while guiding them to prevent a rather horrific collapse of several infrastructure<br /> <br /> also, I think you'll like this: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ieNNFyf9Q78\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ieNNFyf9Q78</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 09-07-2014, 10:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T20:02:04-07:00","id":251882,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/251515-random-silly-demon-things-to-do-quick-fun-ways-to-get-yourself-completely-killed?p=251872#post251872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you misspelling Madoka?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://wiki.puella-magi.net/Meduka_meguca\" target=\"_blank\">I am not.</a><br /> <br /> Don't throw souls, kids.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T20:05:30-07:00","id":251884,"title":"","content":"I was also quoting MeduKa Meguca.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T21:11:51-07:00","id":251934,"title":"","content":"I know, I was being trolly lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.