ront of me a keyboard of millions of keys, millions and billions of keys that never end. And that\u2019s the truth Max, that they never end. That keyboard is infinite\u2026 and if that keyboard is infinite, then on that keyboard there is no music you can play. You\u2019re sitting on the wrong bench\u2026. That is God\u2019s piano.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T06:20:59-07:00","id":252239,"title":"","content":"Being Deamun is suffering","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T09:50:05-07:00","id":252434,"title":"","content":"Well not something that is usually life threatening, there is a pair of demons who were originally one angel that had been divided into two &quot;sister&quot; units, and when both fell one of them discovered that they could use Merge in a slightly different way with her &quot;Brother&quot;. Her brother's demonic form was essentially a metal skeleton while hers was a very evangelion/gundam-esque suit, and I decided that with with these two